id: evil-aura-dark-power-rising
name: Dark Power Rising
order: 3
slot: burst
description: >
  The culmination of evil energy inside you reaches a bursting point!
text: >
  Dark Power Rising: The culmination of evil energy inside you reaches a bursting point!
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Use the Power Up Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, maximize your Evil Points.

---

# Burst Limit: the Power Up out of sequence, and the Evil Points at their most.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 1]
maneuverOutOfSequence(power-up);
evilpoints.stacks += 99;
